{"description":"Typical Parisian family apartment of 110 m2, located close to all the Olympic sites, will seduce you with its large spaces and charm.Located in a lively shopping area, you can easily get around Paris on foot or by transport: 10-minute walk from the RER Denfert Rochereau (RER), 15-minute walk from Montparnasse train station, close to line 4 and many buses.A card of 10 transport tickets/person will be offered with the apartment!The spaceThe apartment is on three floors, the first level consists of a large living room with a kitchen, bathroom and toilet.On the first floor, a master bedroom with an adjoining shower, a children's bedroom with two beds and a toilet (on this floor a room will be closed off).on the top floor, an office with a double sofa.Guest accessThe apartment is located on the 4th floor without elevator, on a quiet street.Other things to notePets not allowedRegistration details7511411346226","amenities":[{"title":"City skyline view","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Washing machine","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"TV","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Piano","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Smoke alarm","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Wifi","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Dedicated workspace","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Kitchen","available":true,"subtitle":"Space where guests can cook their own meals"},{"title":"Exterior security cameras on property","available":false,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Tumble dryer","available":false,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Air conditioning","available":false,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Essentials","available":false,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Carbon monoxide alarm","available":false,"subtitle":"This place may not have a carbon monoxide detector. Contact the host with any questions."},{"title":"Heating","available":false,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Hot water","available":false,"subtitle":""}],"cancellation":[],"rules":[],"facts":{"kitchen":{"value":true,